.TH HERDSMAN-PRUNE 1 "" "herdsman" "herdsman manual"
.SH NAME
herdsman-prune \- Free integrated worktrees past a minimum age.
.SH DESCRIPTION
.nf
usage: herdsman prune [--min-age <duration>] [--dry-run] [--json]

Frees integrated trees older than --min-age (default 1d; 12h and 3d both work).
Locked, dirty and current trees, and tasks still running, are skipped.

exit codes:
  0  every eligible tree was freed
  1  a tree could not be freed
  2  bad usage
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR herdsman (1)
